<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs have kidnapped local officials to force the release of a detained member, while Mexico's defense minister warned that cartels are increasingly using drones for attacks. The U.S. Treasury sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities linked to a cartel-controlled horse-racing and business network. Cartel groups are stealing U.S. rental cars and trucks and converting them into heavily armored vehicles for cross-border operations. Six people, including children, were killed in Mexico by cyclones and flooding from Hurricane Simon and Tropical Storm Rachel remnants. The UCDP recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNVGM2dm9HNmlqTkdMODFpV09LT2YxRWloWXUtTk5KaFV1NTVxWDMtNlRwZDY3Z2M3WFBpZ2JVS2tsVUY5eko1Mldtd3RPMTM3aFFaNGZYS3dZbkZvbjZLelNISHB1dlk1Z3B2Zy1xWVJudzhIaXVXeWNjQkxIX2x5VThzUnZ1Y25HTjV5eHBVNm1jSlk3S1c2Qm90ZkZLUkRpU3JHX18tdld4U0U0R2hhVHdwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPOXhDQ3dIbkpmRndpS3NsTFF4SDdIb3Y4QVh2dXEwZDQzME1jRHY4cHlXVmdEV2h3anRMRXB6Uld5YWt0SGxFeklpTl9xdGk1ODJIbUFaYmc4R1M2cWZ1dHNITVVRZzI1N0JCbG43UW83QXJVYjQ5anRnbzFsYTBjcFNTdWt0YWtQeGFJRGNGSTkwUjFvdDJJVVJ4QkRUSkQ4QmdJUG56UC1BWjBIaVk5dmdpTktZcThm?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQRk8tVlAzWjJIVFRsWklIRWVDVVJBU2EzcTlvalNWWTdfUnA4R2tfSHhMaDFmRXBQWFpacTFPcVIwRnZaRHFkV0RDLVI0dTVKQ1dwZzlkeTNUMjNyV2EzVG43WjhqU1ptSVI4alZmOC0zSUJKQUZwbi00WFcxeDQtNWRIV0dfOHJVY1JJczgxUm4xeUo0RDFFTmhpTzg1eENGeWFNLXRhMFN0REI